{"id": "sewer-improvement-phase-one-budget", "title": "San Francisco raised its first-phase sewer budget by $1.49 billion", "seconds": 68.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.073, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "552f692ed10a4392", "words": 186, "beats": [{"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "One sewer program had four approved budgets in six years.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.58, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "baseline", "text": "Program Revision", "mark": "Revision"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.61, 1.06, 1.27, 1.59, 2.03, 2.45, 2.58, 2.88]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The 2016 budget for the first phase was $2.91 billion.", "t0": 3.7, "t1": 8.71, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2.91 billion", "label": "Phase 1 approved in 2016"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.43, 0.95, 1.32, 1.44, 1.56, 1.86, 2.65, 2.89, 3.13, 3.47, 3.89, 4.12, 4.48]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Its target finish was October 2026.", "t0": 8.83, "t1": 11.64, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "October 2026", "label": "Original approved finish"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.64, 1.0, 1.23, 1.75, 2.08]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Two years later, the utility briefly moved the deadline forward.", "t0": 11.76, "t1": 15.21, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "May 2025", "label": "2018 decision"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.54, 0.89, 1.03, 1.57, 2.03, 2.39, 2.51, 2.98]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "By 2022, the budget had reached $4.40 billion.", "t0": 15.33, "t1": 19.97, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$4.40 billion", "label": "Revised Phase 1 approval"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.51, 1.59, 1.73, 2.02, 2.17, 2.51, 2.76, 3.04, 3.43, 3.78, 4.14]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The utility pushed the finish back 68 months, to June 2032.", "t0": 20.09, "t1": 24.74, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "68 months", "label": "Change from the original approval"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.7, 1.01, 1.13, 1.45, 1.73, 2.44, 3.22, 3.39, 3.68, 3.96]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The plant’s digesters accounted for part of that work.", "t0": 24.96, "t1": 27.56, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "analyst", "text": "Biosolids Digester Facilities Project", "mark": "Digester"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.55, 1.21, 1.62, 1.78, 1.97, 2.06, 2.23]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Their early estimate was $1.75 billion.", "t0": 27.68, "t1": 30.93, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1.750 billion", "label": "Original digester estimate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.56, 0.99, 1.18, 1.4, 1.68, 1.99, 2.28, 2.67]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "By June 2026, the utility forecast a cost of $2.8371 billion.", "t0": 31.05, "t1": 37.9, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2.8371 billion", "label": "Digester project forecast"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.55, 0.86, 2.01, 2.2, 2.66, 3.2, 3.29, 3.67, 3.79, 4.08, 4.39, 4.68, 5.07, 5.44, 5.69, 6.26]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That fall, crews were still testing the equipment.", "t0": 38.02, "t1": 40.87, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "digester", "text": "Component and functional testing", "mark": "testing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 1.02, 1.4, 1.55, 1.81, 2.24, 2.35]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The new headworks had already entered service in summer 2024.", "t0": 40.99, "t1": 44.72, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "Summer 2024", "label": "New headworks completion"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.4, 0.92, 1.07, 1.55, 1.85, 2.27, 2.41, 2.72, 3.02]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The old headworks came down for less than expected.", "t0": 44.84, "t1": 47.54, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "projects", "text": "efficiency achieved", "mark": "efficiency"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.41, 0.89, 1.2, 1.55, 1.73, 1.98, 2.14]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "By June 2026, first-phase spending stood at $4.184 billion.", "t0": 47.76, "t1": 53.65, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$4.184 billion", "label": "Phase 1 spending"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.57, 0.9, 2.09, 2.71, 3.19, 3.47, 3.59, 3.82, 4.09, 4.36, 4.67, 4.97, 5.36]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The forecast was $15.5 million above the current budget.", "t0": 53.77, "t1": 58.38, "shot": "s13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$15.5 million", "label": "Forecast above approved budget"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.73, 0.92, 1.43, 1.75, 2.16, 2.63, 3.36, 3.8, 3.9, 4.22]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The new forecast also moved completion forward five years.", "t0": 58.5, "t1": 61.49, "shot": "s14", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "June 2029", "label": "Forecast finish in the June 2026 report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.3, 0.89, 1.21, 1.46, 1.94, 2.27, 2.56]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The final cost depends on the work still outstanding.", "t0": 61.61, "t1": 64.59, "shot": "s15", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "latest", "text": "Forecast Cost", "mark": "Forecast"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.63, 1.08, 1.48, 1.57, 1.68, 1.95, 2.2]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 64.71, "t1": 67.18, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.86, 1.03, 1.31, 1.39, 1.49, 1.74, 2.02]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"a": "Four approvals", "b": "Two plant projects", "c": "What the utility spent"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "document"}